    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Potion Pals is a fast paced arcade puzzle adventure with local multiplayer vs battles and online. Or play in a casual cosy endless mode for high scores and stats. Also try the story mode, where cute characters try and solve problems through the medium of potion puzzle battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of colourful characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer battle mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer battle mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosy endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode with challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade VS Battles against 2 or 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 tracks of original puzzle blasting music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Potion Pals is a love letter to classic puzzle battle games made by a super small team of one developer. Support indie developers!</p>",
